        "code": "SUCCESS",
        "msg": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "data": "+-------+-------+\n|user_id|   city|\n+-------+-------+\n|     u1| Berlin|\n|     u2| Berlin|\n|     u3| Munich|\n|     u4|Hamburg|\n+-------+-------+\n\n+--------+-------+----------+---+-----+\n|order_id|user_id|product_id|qty|price|\n+--------+-------+----------+---+-----+\n|      o1|     u1|        p1|  2| 10.0|\n|      o2|     u1|        p2|  1| 30.0|\n|      o3|     u2|        p1|  1| 10.0|\n|      o4|     u2|        p3|  5|  7.0|\n|      o5|     u3|        p2|  3| 30.0|\n|      o6|     u3|        p3|  1|  7.0|\n|      o7|     u4|        p1| 10| 10.0|\n+--------+-------+----------+---+-----+\n\n+----------+------------+\n|product_id|product_name|\n+----------+------------+\n|        p1|   Ring VOLA|\n|        p2|  Ring POROG|\n|        p3|Ring TISHINA|\n+----------+------------+\n\n"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "%spark.pyspark\n\norders_with_revenue = orders.withColumn(\n    \"revenue\",\n    F.col(\"qty\") * F.col(\"price\")\n)\n\njoined_df = (\n    orders_with_revenue\n    .join(users, on=\"user_id\", how=\"inner\")\n    .join(products, on=\"product_id\", how=\"inner\")\n)\n\ncity_product_metrics = (\n    joined_df\n    .groupBy(\"city\", \"product_id\", \"product_name\")\n    .agg(\n        F.count(\"order_id\").alias(\"orders_cnt\"),\n        F.sum(\"qty\").alias(\"qty_sum\"),\n        F.sum(\"revenue\").alias(\"revenue_sum\")\n    )\n)\n\nwindow_spec = (\n    Window\n    .partitionBy(\"city\")\n    .orderBy(F.col(\"revenue_sum\").desc(), F.col(\"product_id\").asc())\n)\n\nmart_city_top_products = (\n    city_product_metrics\n    .withColumn(\"rn\", F.row_number().over(window_spec))\n    .filter(F.col(\"rn\") <= 2)\n    .drop(\"rn\")\n    .orderBy(\"city\", F.col(\"revenue_sum\").desc())\n)\n\nmart_city_top_products.show()\n",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-04-29T15:57:28+0000",
